### 2. Pengujian Otomatis Auth & Restriksi RBAC (HTTP Requests)
```
=== 1. Fetching Login Page to get CSRF Token ===
HTTP Status: 200 | CSRF Token generated.

=== 2. Attempting Login as 'superadmin' ===
HTTP Status: 303 Redirect to /dashboard

=== 3. Accessing /dashboard as Superadmin ===
HTTP Status: 200
SUCCESS: Dashboard loaded successfully for Superadmin!

=== 4. Accessing /users as Superadmin ===
HTTP Status: 200
SUCCESS: /users loaded successfully for Superadmin!

=== 5. Logging out & Login as 'perencana' ===
HTTP Status: 303 Redirect to /dashboard

=== 6. Accessing /users as 'perencana' (RBAC Bypass Attempt) ===
HTTP Status: 403
SUCCESS: RbacFilter correctly blocked 'perencana' with 403 Forbidden Access Denied!
```

